<!DOCTYPE article PUBLIC "-//NLM//DTD Journal Archiving and Interchange DTD v2.3 20070202//EN" "archivearticle.dtd"><article xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" article-type="review-article"><?properties open_access?><front><journal-meta><journal-id journal-id-type="nlm-ta">Yale J Biol Med</journal-id><journal-title>The Yale Journal of Biology and Medicine</journal-title><issn pub-type="ppub">0044-0086</issn><issn pub-type="epub">1551-4056</issn></journal-meta><article-meta><article-id pub-id-type="pmid">356435</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="pmc">2595665</article-id><article-id pub-id-type="pmid">356435</article-id><article-categories><subj-group subj-group-type="heading"><subject>Medical Review</subject></subj-group></article-categories><title-group><article-title>Sudden Cardiac Death</article-title></title-group><contrib-group><contrib contrib-type="author"><name><surname>Weinberg</surname><given-names>Marc</given-names></name></contrib></contrib-group><pub-date pub-type="ppub"><season>Mar-Apr</season><year>1978</year></pub-date><volume>51</volume><issue>2</issue><fpage>207</fpage><lpage>217</lpage><abstract><p>Over the past decade, there has been a significant decrease in the hospital mortality of patients with coronary artery disease. However, sudden cardiac death, which accounts for the majority of deaths from coronary artery disease, hasbeen little affected. This report reviews the pathology, electrophysiology, demographics and clinical presentation of sudden cardiac death. Emergency care and possible preventative measures are examined.</p></abstract></article-meta></front><body><supplementary-material content-type="scanned-pages"><graphic xlink:href="yjbm00131-0111.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="207" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="yjbm00131-0112.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="208" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="yjbm00131-0113.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="209" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="yjbm00131-0114.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="210" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="yjbm00131-0115.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="211" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="yjbm00131-0116.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="212" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="yjbm00131-0117.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="213" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="yjbm00131-0118.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="214" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="yjbm00131-0119.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="215" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="yjbm00131-0120.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="216" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/><graphic xlink:href="yjbm00131-0121.tif" xlink:title="scanned-page" xlink:role="217" mimetype="image" mime-subtype="tiff"/></supplementary-material></body></article>